# Dancing Stage featuring TRUE KiSS DESTiNATiON (G*884 VER. JAA): the first power-on. The RTC data
# is initialised, then "FLASH ROM PROTECT CODE UNMATCHED / DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?" (by
# frame ~1100): Test answers yes, and the game copies itself to the onboard flash ("FLASH-ROM
# INITIALIZE COMPLETE", by ~23000). Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames.
game dsftkd

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1500 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
